    "detailed_description": "Gnome Game sends you on the journey of a gnome who has been given a special quest: save the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your gnome to your liking and go forth on an adventure to wreak total havoc in retail stores, restaurants, offices and more unique locations. Being a gnome is not all easy fun and play though, sometimes the knights will try to bring a stop to your antics. Use your agility, cunning and speed to outmaneuver the knights and achieve total mayhem.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis indie game is a 3rd person RPG experience with a short story about making the world a better place. Drawing on iconic viral gnomes, this game aims to provide a fun experience of living the gnome meme for yourself.",
    "about_the_game": "Gnome Game sends you on the journey of a gnome who has been given a special quest: save the world!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your gnome to your liking and go forth on an adventure to wreak total havoc in retail stores, restaurants, offices and more unique locations. Being a gnome is not all easy fun and play though, sometimes the knights will try to bring a stop to your antics. Use your agility, cunning and speed to outmaneuver the knights and achieve total mayhem.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis indie game is a 3rd person RPG experience with a short story about making the world a better place. Drawing on iconic viral gnomes, this game aims to provide a fun experience of living the gnome meme for yourself.",
    "short_description": "Gnome induced mayhem awaits you! A 3D, 3rd person, RPG experience inspired by viral gnomes of the internet. Wreak havoc in the clothing outlet store, evade the knights and fulfill your destiny, as a gnome, to save our world as we know it.",
